### C.jet_bitcoin_version_canonical.bitcoin_transaction_version_spec_parametric
bitcoin_transaction_version_spec_parametric
     : @Bitcoin.PrimitiveBitcoin.Primitive.Parametric Ty.Unit (Word.Word (S (S (S (S (S O))))))
         (@bitcoin_transaction_version_spec)
### C.jet_bitcoin_version_canonical.bitcoin_transaction_version_spec_sem
bitcoin_transaction_version_spec_sem
     : forall environment : Bitcoin.Bitcoin.env,
       @eq
         (Monad.CIMonad.domain (Monad.MonadZero.to_Monad Option.option_Monad_Zero)
            (Ty.tySem (Word.Word (S (S (S (S (S O))))))))
         (@bitcoin_transaction_version_spec
